WEBVTT

00:00:01.874 --> 00:00:05.334
BABEL FUJI COMPREHENSIVE
RESEARCH FACILITY

00:00:08.544 --> 00:00:11.254
Your task is, under my direction,

00:00:11.254 --> 00:00:15.084
to steal the stuffed animals carried
by each of the three Children.

00:00:15.654 --> 00:00:18.054
They won't be holding back,
so be ready for anything!

00:00:18.054 --> 00:00:20.664
That's our line, you traitor!

00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:21.764
Creep!

00:00:21.764 --> 00:00:22.284
Philanderer.

00:00:26.104 --> 00:00:28.224
So what if she's kinda cute...

00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:29.534
Huh?

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:33.404
Shut up! We're playing for
keeps on this, you jerk!

00:00:36.714 --> 00:00:38.674
The Children, released.

00:00:43.584 --> 00:00:45.744
Like a moth drawn to a flame!

00:00:47.654 --> 00:00:49.714
It might be time to pay the piper!

00:00:51.494 --> 00:00:53.684
We'll teach you the difference
between your powers and ours!

00:00:55.124 --> 00:00:57.394
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:00:59.264 --> 00:01:02.164
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:01:02.574 --> 00:01:05.434
Boy, does it feel great

00:01:05.804 --> 00:01:08.574
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:09.014 --> 00:01:12.174
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:01:14.084 --> 00:01:15.214
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:15.214 --> 00:01:16.384
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:01:16.384 --> 00:01:17.654
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:01:17.654 --> 00:01:19.324
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:19.324 --> 00:01:20.344
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:01:20.524 --> 00:01:23.824
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:01:23.824 --> 00:01:26.254
The limiter on my heart

00:01:26.994 --> 00:01:29.694
Has been released, and then you see

00:01:30.094 --> 00:01:33.294
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:33.534 --> 00:01:36.404
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:01:36.704 --> 00:01:40.004
Reaching through what's real

00:01:40.004 --> 00:01:43.244
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:43.244 --> 00:01:46.174
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:01:47.314 --> 00:01:53.784
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:01:53.784 --> 00:01:59.724
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:02:00.164 --> 00:02:04.534
If you can take pride in a smile

00:02:04.534 --> 00:02:06.554
That suits no one else

00:02:06.764 --> 00:02:11.274
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:02:11.274 --> 00:02:15.404
We can try over the future world!

00:02:15.644 --> 00:02:16.004
Yeah!

00:02:16.744 --> 00:02:17.364
Ultimate!

00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:20.744
Daring!

00:02:29.724 --> 00:02:32.154
Okay, we'll be waiting.

00:02:35.894 --> 00:02:39.594
There's nothing to worry about. I know you'll win!

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:46.274
If you're wondering why Minamoto
is commanding these two,

00:02:46.274 --> 00:02:49.844
and why they're fighting this battle
exercise with The Children,

00:02:49.844 --> 00:02:51.274
we'll have to flash back in this story a few days.

00:02:51.274 --> 00:02:52.744
17th sense.
"Survival of the Fittest! We're Gonna Eat You!"
we'll have to flash back in this story a few days.

00:02:52.744 --> 00:02:53.014
17th sense.
"Survival of the Fittest! We're Gonna Eat You!"

00:02:53.014 --> 00:02:53.414
17th sense.
"Survival of the Fittest! We're Gonna Eat You!"
Candidates to be BABEL special espers?

00:02:53.414 --> 00:02:55.314
Candidates to be BABEL special espers?

00:02:55.314 --> 00:02:57.184
Yes. Kashiwagi?

00:02:57.184 --> 00:02:58.654
Yes, sir.

00:02:58.654 --> 00:03:01.744
We got the results of their
entrance test a few days ago.

00:03:06.194 --> 00:03:06.694
AKIRA YADORIGI (Age 15)

00:03:06.694 --> 00:03:08.164
AKIRA YADORIGI (Age 15)
Akira Yadorigi. Age: 15.

00:03:08.164 --> 00:03:08.694
Akira Yadorigi. Age: 15.

00:03:08.694 --> 00:03:09.334
HATSUNE INUGAMI (Age 14)
Akira Yadorigi. Age: 15.

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:10.694
HATSUNE INUGAMI (Age 14)
And Hatsune Inugami. Age: 14.

00:03:10.694 --> 00:03:11.524
And Hatsune Inugami. Age: 14.

00:03:16.174 --> 00:03:19.174
Her power is Metamorphosis.

00:03:19.174 --> 00:03:21.364
She can transform herself into a wolf.

00:03:23.144 --> 00:03:26.544
And his power is Replace.

00:03:32.284 --> 00:03:35.924
He can exchange consciousness
with any nearby animal.

00:03:35.924 --> 00:03:37.784
They're combination espers, aren't they?

00:03:38.254 --> 00:03:39.364
Right.

00:03:39.364 --> 00:03:42.194
Unlike The Children, they don't have one power

00:03:42.194 --> 00:03:44.194
that makes them high-level espers.

00:03:44.194 --> 00:03:46.134
However, despite their low-level,

00:03:46.134 --> 00:03:49.134
they unconsciously combine
several of their abilities.

00:03:49.134 --> 00:03:53.074
Allowing them to operate as high-level espers.

00:03:54.044 --> 00:03:54.434
THREE

00:03:55.044 --> 00:03:55.444
TWO

00:03:56.044 --> 00:03:56.474
ONE

00:04:02.514 --> 00:04:07.544
Go get 'em, my 1:1 scale Ji-Ei Joes!

00:04:17.464 --> 00:04:22.194
My 1:1 scale Ji-Ei Joes!

00:04:26.744 --> 00:04:27.674
Amazing!

00:04:29.174 --> 00:04:32.374
The two have great potential, but...

00:04:32.374 --> 00:04:36.154
They failed this part of the entrance exam.

00:04:36.154 --> 00:04:38.144
Even with the powers they demonstrated?

00:04:38.514 --> 00:04:39.284
Observe.

00:04:51.394 --> 00:04:53.664
Hatsune! There's one left!

00:05:00.444 --> 00:05:02.034
Food!

00:05:04.174 --> 00:05:05.834
Hatsune, no!

00:05:07.644 --> 00:05:08.804
Food!

00:05:19.264 --> 00:05:24.294
When she's hungry, Hatsune's
animal instincts take over.

00:05:24.294 --> 00:05:26.264
So, whenever she uses her
Metamorphosis power,

00:05:26.264 --> 00:05:29.774
they need to keep her hunger
level under control.

00:05:29.774 --> 00:05:31.834
She abandons the mission if she's hungry?

00:05:31.834 --> 00:05:33.844
Yes. She forgets it completely.

00:05:33.844 --> 00:05:36.714
Now then, Minamoto. As to your duty here...

00:05:36.714 --> 00:05:37.874
Yes, sir?

00:05:37.874 --> 00:05:42.584
I want you to instruct them so that
they can pass their entrance exam!

00:05:42.584 --> 00:05:43.914
Huh?!

00:05:46.924 --> 00:05:49.494
So, Hatsune's family, the Inugami clan,

00:05:49.494 --> 00:05:52.254
have had metamorphic abilities for generations.

00:05:52.254 --> 00:05:54.824
And Akira's family, the Yadorigi clan,

00:05:54.824 --> 00:05:56.594
have taken care of them since antiquity.

00:05:57.534 --> 00:05:59.364
Hatsune, it's ready!

00:05:59.434 --> 00:06:00.524
Food!

00:06:02.874 --> 00:06:05.934
No! You stand up when you walk!

00:06:05.934 --> 00:06:08.374
I'm always telling you not to
walk on your hands, right?!

00:06:09.514 --> 00:06:10.844
Food!

00:06:13.944 --> 00:06:15.534
What do you say before you eat?

00:06:18.314 --> 00:06:19.914
Don't stick out your tongue!

00:06:20.784 --> 00:06:22.944
What do you say before you eat?

00:06:25.854 --> 00:06:27.654
All done!

00:06:29.964 --> 00:06:32.294
Use your hands when you eat!

00:06:41.044 --> 00:06:42.304
Down the hatch...

00:06:42.304 --> 00:06:46.214
So, not only childhood friends,
but a hereditary combo, too.

00:06:46.214 --> 00:06:49.044
They have no problems combining their powers,

00:06:49.044 --> 00:06:53.224
so conquering Hatsune's weakness
is the key to them passing.

00:06:53.224 --> 00:06:55.684
Minamoto! When's dinner?

00:06:56.194 --> 00:06:58.454
Sorry! Order a pizza or something, okay?

00:06:58.854 --> 00:07:00.414
I'm busy with work!

00:07:01.764 --> 00:07:03.924
What's with him?

00:07:05.994 --> 00:07:07.864
You'll be instructing us, Mr. Minamoto?!

00:07:09.674 --> 00:07:11.064
I look forward to it.

00:07:11.774 --> 00:07:13.344
I'm so grateful!

00:07:13.344 --> 00:07:14.904
Why?

00:07:14.904 --> 00:07:19.514
Because you're the genius instructor
who managed to shape up The Children,

00:07:19.514 --> 00:07:23.214
the worst team in BABEL that nobody
else was able to control!

00:07:24.084 --> 00:07:26.724
Um, those are just rumors.

00:07:26.724 --> 00:07:29.224
And The Children were hardly the worst team...

00:07:29.224 --> 00:07:33.554
To be instructed by a person
like you, I... I... I...

00:07:37.964 --> 00:07:39.334
How do you do?

00:07:44.004 --> 00:07:46.194
No! Bad Hatsune!

00:07:53.014 --> 00:07:55.344
Hatsune... can't resist!

00:07:55.344 --> 00:07:56.684
Hang on, Hatsune!

00:07:56.684 --> 00:07:58.784
Resist it, Hatsune!

00:07:58.784 --> 00:08:01.944
Hatsune... can't... resist!

00:08:07.294 --> 00:08:08.154
Ow.

00:08:14.564 --> 00:08:16.264
Okay, there you go!

00:08:18.374 --> 00:08:20.104
Hatsune, cut it out!

00:08:41.924 --> 00:08:43.634
How many days has it been?

00:08:43.634 --> 00:08:47.304
Let's see. One, two, three...

00:08:47.304 --> 00:08:49.364
Today, we move to stage two.

00:08:52.374 --> 00:08:54.894
Resist, Hatsune! Resist!

00:08:55.204 --> 00:08:56.364
Resist.

00:08:58.974 --> 00:09:00.084
Please begin.

00:09:00.084 --> 00:09:01.244
Right.

00:09:08.884 --> 00:09:10.454
What's she doing?

00:09:10.454 --> 00:09:12.154
She's a telepath.

00:09:12.154 --> 00:09:17.064
She's filling Hatsune's mind with images of food.

00:09:18.294 --> 00:09:22.094
If she can pass this test, then
I'm sure Hatsune is ready!

00:09:23.074 --> 00:09:24.704
Hatsune... can't resist...

00:09:24.704 --> 00:09:26.474
No, you can! Hang in there!

00:09:26.474 --> 00:09:27.774
Can't...

00:09:28.544 --> 00:09:30.234
resist...

00:09:38.284 --> 00:09:41.984
I don't taste very good. Right, Natsuko?

00:09:41.984 --> 00:09:45.854
I... think Hotaru tastes better than me, though.

00:09:48.794 --> 00:09:53.464
Uh-oh! Hatsune's nothing
but a ravenous beast now!

00:09:53.464 --> 00:09:54.664
Abort training!

00:09:58.674 --> 00:09:58.974
Hatsune!

00:09:58.974 --> 00:09:59.594
Dammit!
Hatsune!

00:10:03.614 --> 00:10:05.044
Mr. Minamoto!

00:10:15.754 --> 00:10:18.794
Hatsune... You wouldn't eat him, would you?

00:10:18.794 --> 00:10:20.254
He's all right!

00:10:28.434 --> 00:10:30.274
Get me out.

00:10:30.274 --> 00:10:33.174
Hatsune tried her best!

00:10:37.674 --> 00:10:41.804
Three, two, one! 60 minutes, on the nose!

00:10:43.214 --> 00:10:44.744
Hatsune, resisted!

00:10:45.384 --> 00:10:47.644
Good girl, Hatsune!

00:10:52.124 --> 00:10:54.094
Great job, Hatsune.

00:10:56.964 --> 00:10:57.824
Food...

00:11:04.134 --> 00:11:06.194
Chopsticks! Use your chopsticks!

00:11:07.044 --> 00:11:09.374
I wonder if I can get reimbursed for this.

00:11:10.144 --> 00:11:12.714
What you've done is amazing, Mr. Minamoto.

00:11:12.714 --> 00:11:16.804
I've never seen Hatsune respond
to anyone like this except me.

00:11:18.014 --> 00:11:21.154
I'm sure it's because of her family.

00:11:21.154 --> 00:11:25.324
That's why she's never had
much contact with Normals.

00:11:25.324 --> 00:11:27.864
I've had to deal with worse than her.

00:11:27.864 --> 00:11:30.384
You really are a genius
supervisor, Mr. Minamoto!

00:11:30.494 --> 00:11:31.834
Please, no.

00:11:31.834 --> 00:11:34.354
I admire you so much! You're awesome!

00:11:39.204 --> 00:11:43.234
You're not planning to become
their supervisor, are you?

00:11:43.874 --> 00:11:44.874
Whose?

00:11:44.874 --> 00:11:50.384
Don't play dumb! That wolf girl and the
other one you've been with lately!

00:11:50.384 --> 00:11:52.084
What's going on?

00:11:52.084 --> 00:11:54.284
We want a reasonable explanation.

00:11:55.954 --> 00:11:57.444
You aren't jealous, are you?

00:11:58.524 --> 00:12:02.694
No, we're not! We don't really need you!

00:12:02.694 --> 00:12:05.434
So, if you want to be their supervisor, then...

00:12:05.434 --> 00:12:07.124
That's a great idea!

00:12:07.664 --> 00:12:10.104
Wanna try fighting those two?

00:12:10.104 --> 00:12:11.474
Fight?

00:12:11.474 --> 00:12:13.674
What do you mean?

00:12:13.674 --> 00:12:15.774
I'll command the other two.

00:12:15.774 --> 00:12:18.974
Okay, fine! We'll take 'em on!

00:12:19.374 --> 00:12:21.614
A battle exercise with The Children?!

00:12:21.614 --> 00:12:24.854
Isn't that setting the hurdles a little too high?

00:12:24.854 --> 00:12:26.954
If they can clear a high hurdle,

00:12:26.954 --> 00:12:30.214
then I think they'll have proven
their aptitude as special espers!

00:12:30.754 --> 00:12:33.314
Minamoto is right.

00:12:35.464 --> 00:12:37.124
All right, you can do it.

00:12:37.994 --> 00:12:40.594
And so, the battle exercise began.

00:12:43.334 --> 00:12:43.804
IN TRAINING

00:12:43.804 --> 00:12:45.434
IN TRAINING
I want a kiss!

00:12:45.434 --> 00:12:45.804
IN TRAINING

00:12:48.174 --> 00:12:49.104
IN TRAINING

00:12:49.104 --> 00:12:50.714
IN TRAINING
Because I'm raising a dog.

00:12:53.014 --> 00:12:57.114
No way Level 7's like us will
lose to newbs like them.

00:12:57.114 --> 00:12:59.184
They're both Level 4's, right?

00:12:59.184 --> 00:13:00.754
Piece of cake!

00:13:00.754 --> 00:13:03.554
Don't be careless, young ones.

00:13:04.654 --> 00:13:05.424
Chief!

00:13:05.424 --> 00:13:06.354
Hello!

00:13:06.354 --> 00:13:07.394
Whatcha doing?

00:13:07.394 --> 00:13:10.064
Um, I am not this "Chief" you speak of!

00:13:10.064 --> 00:13:12.634
I am a mysterious old man
who was just passing by!

00:13:12.634 --> 00:13:15.534
I'm not in disguise because
Kashiwagi would kill me

00:13:15.534 --> 00:13:18.124
if she found out I was showing
you any favoritism!

00:13:21.374 --> 00:13:22.734
Found them!

00:13:28.214 --> 00:13:29.484
Uh-oh! They found us!

00:13:29.484 --> 00:13:30.414
We need to escape, now!

00:13:30.414 --> 00:13:31.814
Emergency Teleport!

00:13:31.814 --> 00:13:33.784
Wait! Me, too!

00:13:35.084 --> 00:13:36.624
Hatsune lost them.

00:13:36.624 --> 00:13:38.214
Don't worry!

00:13:38.924 --> 00:13:41.084
They teleported to 3 o'clock from where you are!

00:13:43.494 --> 00:13:46.964
Peep-peep-peep! Peep! Peep-peep!

00:13:46.964 --> 00:13:51.424
Mr. Minamoto, what's going on?
The Chief is with The Children.

00:13:52.334 --> 00:13:55.394
I thought I didn't see him here!
That stupid old man!

00:13:56.174 --> 00:13:57.244
For heaven's sake.

00:13:57.244 --> 00:13:59.044
Wait, this could be a good thing.

00:13:59.884 --> 00:14:04.914
He's naturally going to advise
The Children about your powers.

00:14:04.914 --> 00:14:07.284
Meaning we can use that against them!

00:14:11.494 --> 00:14:12.984
Here he comes! That snake!

00:14:13.494 --> 00:14:15.624
PSYCHIC HALF-HITCH!

00:14:19.934 --> 00:14:23.234
So, that Akira kid's mind is in this snake?

00:14:23.234 --> 00:14:27.634
No, now it's in something else.

00:14:31.474 --> 00:14:32.604
Snake?

00:14:35.144 --> 00:14:35.914
Got 'em!

00:14:35.914 --> 00:14:39.114
Slither. Slither-slither-slither...

00:14:39.414 --> 00:14:40.524
It worked.

00:14:40.524 --> 00:14:42.524
Just like you wanted,
I scared them with a snake

00:14:42.524 --> 00:14:44.854
and got them to teleport back
to their starting point.

00:14:44.854 --> 00:14:47.194
Aoi can't stand reptiles.

00:14:50.594 --> 00:14:51.694
Ambush!

00:14:51.694 --> 00:14:54.134
Up! Retreat to the air for now!

00:14:54.134 --> 00:14:56.104
PSYCHIC ZOOM CLIMB!

00:14:57.574 --> 00:14:59.774
Hatsune can't chase us into the sky!

00:14:59.774 --> 00:15:02.574
Okay, we'll regroup up here!

00:15:10.254 --> 00:15:11.284
She's flying!

00:15:11.284 --> 00:15:12.754
No one told us about this!

00:15:12.754 --> 00:15:14.184
Is it Minamoto's direction?

00:15:14.184 --> 00:15:15.744
She did it!

00:15:16.024 --> 00:15:18.524
The key is for her to imagine the form.

00:15:18.524 --> 00:15:21.554
Metamorphosis isn't just being
able to turn into a wolf.

00:15:22.564 --> 00:15:25.324
She can also fly for short periods, too!

00:15:26.964 --> 00:15:29.834
And having four people to teleport
limits their range!

00:15:31.374 --> 00:15:34.164
Hatsune is chasing The Children.

00:15:34.574 --> 00:15:37.204
Hatsune... is winning!

00:15:37.914 --> 00:15:42.374
Minamoto is amazing. Hatsune loves Minamoto!

00:15:47.954 --> 00:15:49.974
Aoi, enough!

00:15:51.494 --> 00:15:52.254
Kaoru!

00:15:52.254 --> 00:15:54.694
No way I'm losing to someone like you!

00:15:54.864 --> 00:15:58.024
PSYCHIC AIR-SLASHES!

00:16:07.474 --> 00:16:08.964
Come back here!

00:16:19.084 --> 00:16:21.514
Darn it! Is this a trap set by Minamoto?

00:16:22.984 --> 00:16:24.954
Why, you!

00:16:26.964 --> 00:16:30.034
Psychic... Huh?

00:16:30.034 --> 00:16:34.034
Forget it. You can't use
your psychic powers now.

00:16:34.034 --> 00:16:37.494
The reason being that isn't your body.

00:16:38.504 --> 00:16:39.434
Huh?

00:16:40.104 --> 00:16:42.804
My power also works on people.

00:16:42.804 --> 00:16:44.114
Y-You're me?!

00:16:44.114 --> 00:16:46.634
I switched minds with you.

00:16:46.984 --> 00:16:49.074
And that's one stuffie down!

00:16:49.214 --> 00:16:50.514
Aw, man!

00:16:53.754 --> 00:16:57.284
I'd say you're not ready to take me on yet.

00:17:00.124 --> 00:17:01.864
So, I just follow the plan now?

00:17:01.864 --> 00:17:04.694
Right, just be careful not to move too far away.

00:17:05.134 --> 00:17:07.464
Yes, sir! Leave it to me!

00:17:09.564 --> 00:17:12.574
You jerk! You're our supervisor, aren't you?!

00:17:12.574 --> 00:17:16.034
Aren't you supposed to go
easy on us and let us win?!

00:17:16.344 --> 00:17:18.344
Don't be so selfish!

00:17:18.344 --> 00:17:21.314
I'm not being selfish! I'm saying you're wrong!

00:17:21.314 --> 00:17:24.514
No... I want to be close with Minamoto...

00:17:27.424 --> 00:17:30.354
Minamoto is mine!

00:17:33.394 --> 00:17:34.694
Hatsune?

00:17:34.694 --> 00:17:36.784
MINE!

00:17:39.664 --> 00:17:41.964
Minamoto?! Wait!

00:17:45.904 --> 00:17:46.804
Kaoru!

00:17:47.644 --> 00:17:49.334
You're all right?

00:17:52.414 --> 00:17:53.614
What are you doing?!

00:17:53.614 --> 00:17:55.684
Two stuffies, down!

00:17:55.684 --> 00:17:57.414
It can't be! Yadorigi?!

00:17:58.484 --> 00:18:01.544
One left! I'm going to win!

00:18:01.784 --> 00:18:04.514
My fists won't allow you to!

00:18:06.394 --> 00:18:10.464
That's not fair! I can't fight you looking like that!

00:18:10.464 --> 00:18:13.894
And now, we'll be special espers, like you.

00:18:15.664 --> 00:18:17.794
Huh? My body's...

00:18:20.574 --> 00:18:22.704
Wh-What happened?

00:18:23.444 --> 00:18:25.814
He moved too far from his actual body.

00:18:25.814 --> 00:18:28.214
His brainwaves destabilized.

00:18:28.384 --> 00:18:30.914
He doesn't actually switch minds with a subject.

00:18:30.914 --> 00:18:34.214
He just uses his composite abilities to
transceive thoughts to another body.

00:18:34.824 --> 00:18:37.184
So, if he leaves his effective range...

00:18:38.494 --> 00:18:39.654
Where am I?!

00:18:39.654 --> 00:18:41.854
Kaoru returns to normal.

00:18:42.094 --> 00:18:44.324
No time for this! Minamoto's been!

00:18:47.104 --> 00:18:49.704
Mr. Minamoto, what's going on?!

00:18:49.704 --> 00:18:51.974
I thought we'd gotten Hatsune's
hunger under control!

00:18:51.974 --> 00:18:53.944
No, this isn't hunger!

00:18:53.944 --> 00:18:58.074
Right now, she's operating on one
desire that goes beyond hunger!

00:18:58.074 --> 00:18:59.874
A desire beyond hunger?!

00:18:59.874 --> 00:19:01.974
Minamoto is mine!

00:19:08.484 --> 00:19:09.384
Hatsune!

00:19:14.124 --> 00:19:16.114
What's wrong, Hatsune?

00:19:19.734 --> 00:19:21.194
Give Minamoto back!

00:19:24.304 --> 00:19:26.964
No! Minamoto is mine!

00:19:28.274 --> 00:19:31.674
Oh, get real! What do you mean, he's yours?!

00:19:31.674 --> 00:19:35.914
MINAMOTO BELONGS TO US!

00:19:52.534 --> 00:19:55.394
You're the boss! This is yours!

00:19:57.034 --> 00:20:02.004
The force of Kaoru's anger made
Hatsune accept Kaoru as her superior.

00:20:02.004 --> 00:20:07.314
So, what was the desire beyond hunger
that was driving Hatsune before?

00:20:07.844 --> 00:20:09.474
Hatsune!

00:20:10.984 --> 00:20:12.074
Akira! Now!

00:20:14.184 --> 00:20:15.784
Third stuffie, down!

00:20:15.784 --> 00:20:16.554
Ooh!

00:20:17.654 --> 00:20:19.354
Never let your guard down.

00:20:19.354 --> 00:20:21.654
We did it, Mr. Minamoto!

00:20:24.194 --> 00:20:26.524
No! Minamoto is the boss's!

00:20:27.964 --> 00:20:30.204
They passed, right, Chief?

00:20:30.204 --> 00:20:33.334
Um, I'm just a mysterious old
man who was passing by...

00:20:33.334 --> 00:20:34.804
Chief?

00:20:34.804 --> 00:20:35.674
Yes?

00:20:35.674 --> 00:20:37.374
They passed, right?

00:20:37.374 --> 00:20:38.844
Well... Yeah.

00:20:39.544 --> 00:20:41.014
So, then!

00:20:47.124 --> 00:20:49.854
Welcome to the team, The Hound.

00:20:49.854 --> 00:20:51.554
"The Hound?"

00:20:51.554 --> 00:20:52.954
That's gonna be...

00:20:52.954 --> 00:20:54.424
...your team name.

00:20:54.424 --> 00:20:55.624
Great, huh?

00:20:55.624 --> 00:20:57.894
If you're giving us a team
name, does that mean?

00:20:57.894 --> 00:21:01.764
Yes, BABEL is hiring you to be special espers.

00:21:01.764 --> 00:21:03.424
We did it, Hatsune!

00:21:07.704 --> 00:21:09.404
Hatsune, wait!

00:21:09.404 --> 00:21:10.934
Let's go, too!

00:21:17.414 --> 00:21:18.214
What's?

00:21:18.214 --> 00:21:20.224
Your welcome party.

00:21:20.224 --> 00:21:21.584
Welcome to BABEL.

00:21:21.584 --> 00:21:23.854
All our effort didn't go to waste!

00:21:25.354 --> 00:21:29.424
Thank God. With us being
officially hired by BABEL,

00:21:29.424 --> 00:21:32.794
they'll be responsible for
paying Hatsune's grocery bill!

00:21:32.794 --> 00:21:35.264
My family's finances are saved!

00:21:35.264 --> 00:21:37.074
Are you crying, Akira?

00:21:37.074 --> 00:21:40.744
Shows how much he wanted to
be a special esper, huh?

00:21:40.744 --> 00:21:42.144
Minamoto?

00:21:42.144 --> 00:21:45.444
You're not really going to be supervisor
for The Hound now, right?

00:21:47.184 --> 00:21:49.844
Their supervisor is still being decided upon.

00:21:49.844 --> 00:21:52.514
Besides, I couldn't.

00:21:52.514 --> 00:21:53.884
Why not?

00:21:53.884 --> 00:21:56.544
Because I belong to you girls, right?

00:21:57.854 --> 00:21:58.724
Whatever!

00:22:00.964 --> 00:22:02.064
Hey!

00:22:02.064 --> 00:22:04.654
Oh, it's not completely cooked, yet!

00:22:05.494 --> 00:22:08.164
Boss, I can't wait to work with you!

00:22:10.704 --> 00:22:16.104
Because, you're my heart's desire!

00:22:16.104 --> 00:22:16.404
Yeah

00:22:33.454 --> 00:22:36.724
When it comes to you, you see

00:22:38.464 --> 00:22:43.994
My ESP is no good at all

00:22:44.334 --> 00:22:50.464
Love is a puzzle that even

00:22:50.844 --> 00:22:53.104
Pythagoras couldn't solve

00:22:55.344 --> 00:23:00.044
Don't hang your head or have a tearful face

00:23:00.484 --> 00:23:05.354
Because miracles are born from smiles

00:23:06.024 --> 00:23:07.464
My, my, my heart's desire

00:23:07.464 --> 00:23:07.764
Zoom zoom!

00:23:07.764 --> 00:23:08.764
I want to make

00:23:08.764 --> 00:23:09.194
Bye-bye!

00:23:09.194 --> 00:23:12.924
You my bold desire

00:23:13.064 --> 00:23:17.074
So absolutely serious, it gives me chills!

00:23:17.074 --> 00:23:18.504
Trans, trans, transform

00:23:18.504 --> 00:23:18.804
Zoom zoom!

00:23:18.804 --> 00:23:19.774
I'll give you

00:23:19.774 --> 00:23:20.404
Yeah yeah!

00:23:20.404 --> 00:23:25.244
A dynamite kiss!

00:23:25.374 --> 00:23:28.144
I absolutely want you to love me!

00:23:28.144 --> 00:23:38.344
Because, you're my heart's desire

00:23:39.894 --> 00:23:40.764
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.764 --> 00:23:42.764
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.964 --> 00:23:46.134
Miss Sannomiya, would you come
see my game this Sunday?

00:23:46.134 --> 00:23:46.994
Sure.

00:23:46.994 --> 00:23:49.334
Miss Nogami, would you like to go
to the planetarium with me?

00:23:49.334 --> 00:23:51.134
Wow, you'll take me?

00:23:51.134 --> 00:23:53.334
Y-Y-You both suddenly have boyfriends?!

00:23:53.744 --> 00:23:55.404
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:55.404 --> 00:23:59.174
Episode 18: "Passionate Love Comes
to Light! The Children's Breakup Crisis!"

00:23:59.174 --> 00:24:02.044
Curse these fiendish men who
would tempt my precious girls!

00:24:02.044 --> 00:24:04.454
Send my A-Team assault unit into action!

00:24:04.454 --> 00:24:04.914
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:04.914 --> 00:24:06.614
Passionate Love Comes to Light!
The Children's Breakup Crisis!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.614 --> 00:24:09.884
Passionate Love Comes to Light!
The Children's Breakup Crisis!
